<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/inspection> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A thorough examination or checking of documentation, records, processes, or systems to confirm compliance or adherence. An inspection needs to have a defined set of acceptance criteria (e.g. a checklist), a documentation of roles involved in the inspection (e.g. to document the inspector's independence) and a clear documentation of when and how it was performed."@en .
